r 14, 2011<br/>Winter Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Fiehonja</b> was implemented at the Winter Update 2011. Underneath the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gray%20Beach\">Gray Beach</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Quirefang\">Quirefang</a> lies the underwater area where the <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeplings\">Deeplings</a> live. Here you can expect to find all sorts of wonderous water creatures which cannot be found anywhere else on the continent including the <a href=\"#/wiki/Manta%20Ray\">Manta Ray</a>.\n</p><p>Access to this area is given through the <a href=\"#/quest/liquid-black-quest\">Liquid Black Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fiehonja</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish%20%28Creature%29\"><img alt=\"Fish (Creature)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fish_Creature_b71890.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish%20%28Creature%29\">Fish (Creature)</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">25</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px;